        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You became a squire to a Hellknight at a young age. As you matured and your opinions developed, you came to find their ethos unacceptable, and went from bearing shields for the Hellknights to bearing weapons against them.</p>\n<p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Strength</strong> or <strong>Constitution</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p>\n<p>You're trained in the Intimidation skill and the Hellknight Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Intimidating Glare] skill feat.</p>"
